      en: ["Birthplace of President Habib Bourguiba", "Home to the historic defensive Ribat", "Key gateway via Monastir International Airport", "Prestigious Sahelian coastal destination", "Features iconic mausoleum architecture", "Balanced blend of history and tourism"]
